---
// Hero section — massive neo-brutalist mechatronics canvas
---
<section class="relative bg-surface-container-lowest border-b-2 border-surface-variant grid-blueprint overflow-hidden pt-space-xl pb-space-2xl">
  <div class="h-1.5 w-full hazard-stripe"></div>
  <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin pt-space-xl">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm mb-space-md">
      <span class="text-label-badge font-label-badge text-primary-container bg-surface-container-high border border-primary-container px-2 py-0.5 uppercase">
        [ 00 // AUTONOMOUS_COMBAT_SYS ]
      </span>
      <span class="text-label-badge font-label-badge text-tertiary">SANCTIONED BY IEEE ROBOTICS &amp; AUTOMATION SOCIETY</span>
      <span class="ml-auto text-label-stamp font-label-stamp text-secondary-container font-mono hidden md:inline-block">HASH: 0x9F44_ROBOKO</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-xl items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="inline-block bg-surface-container-highest px-3 py-1 mb-space-sm border border-surface-variant">
          <span class="text-label-stamp font-label-stamp text-secondary-container">鋼鉄の侍 // DIVISION I • 2025 OPEN CHAMPIONSHIP</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-headline-xl-mobile md:text-headline-xl font-headline-xl uppercase text-on-surface tracking-tighter leading-none mb-space-md">
          STEEL ON STEEL.<br />
          <span class="text-primary-container">ZERO RETREAT.</span><br />
          THE DOHYO AWAITS.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-body-lg font-body-lg text-tertiary max-w-2xl mb-space-xl">
          The IEEE Mechatronics &amp; Robotics Chapter presents the premier autonomous and RC Sumo Robotics tournament. Where ancestral warrior discipline meets modern sensor fusion, 1200N neodymium magnetic downforce, and sub-millisecond edge arbitration.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-md">
          <a class="btn-brutal whitespace-nowrap bg-primary-container text-surface-container-lowest font-headline-sm text-headline-sm px-space-xl py-space-md border-2 border-white uppercase shadow-hard-red flex items-center gap-space-sm hover:bg-on-primary-container hover:text-white" href="#register">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">swords</span>
            <span>DEPLOY ROBOT</span>
          </a>
          <a class="btn-brutal whitespace-nowrap bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-headline-sm text-headline-sm px-space-lg py-space-md border-2 border-surface-variant uppercase shadow-hard-black hover:border-on-surface flex items-center gap-space-sm" href="#dohyo-specs">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">description</span>
            <span>SPEC SHEET V3.2</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="bg-surface-container border-2 border-surface-variant p-space-md shadow-hard-gold relative w-full max-w-md mx-auto lg:max-w-none">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-surface-variant pb-space-sm mb-space-md">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-primary-container"></span>
              <span class="text-label-stamp font-label-stamp text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider">SAMURAI SPIRIT // 武士道魂</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-label-badge font-label-badge text-secondary-container">BUSHIDO: ACTIVE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-variant aspect-square overflow-hidden" role="img" aria-label="Animated rising sun over a torii gate with falling cherry petals and a samurai kanji watermark">
            <span class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface opacity-[0.07] font-bold leading-none text-[11rem] select-none" aria-hidden="true">侍</span>
            <div class="sun-rays absolute left-1/2 top-[16%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[86%] aspect-square rounded-full" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-[16%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[34%] aspect-square rounded-full bg-primary-container border-2 border-white shadow-hard-black" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="absolute left-1/2 bottom-[6%] -translate-x-1/2 w-[74%]" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 200 118" class="w-full h-auto" fill="none">
                <rect x="8" y="8" width="184" height="16" fill="var(--color-accent)" stroke="var(--color-abyss)" stroke-width="4" />
                <rect x="26" y="30" width="148" height="9" fill="var(--color-accent)" stroke="var(--color-abyss)" stroke-width="4" />
                <rect x="42" y="24" width="13" height="88" fill="var(--color-accent)" stroke="var(--color-abyss)" stroke-width="4" />
                <rect x="145" y="24" width="13" height="88" fill="var(--color-accent)" stroke="var(--color-abyss)" stroke-width="4" />
                <rect x="86" y="39" width="28" height="12" fill="var(--color-abyss)" />
                <rect x="28" y="110" width="144" height="8" fill="var(--color-abyss)" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="petal" style="left: 6%; animation-duration: 7s; animation-delay: 0s;"><span class="petal-inner" style="animation-duration: 2.1s;"></span></span>
              <span class="petal" style="left: 18%; animation-duration: 9s; animation-delay: 1.2s;"><span class="petal-inner" style="animation-duration: 2.7s;"></span></span>
              <span class="petal" style="left: 31%; animation-duration: 8s; animation-delay: 3.1s;"><span class="petal-inner" style="animation-duration: 2.3s;"></span></span>
              <span class="petal" style="left: 44%; animation-duration: 10s; animation-delay: 0.6s;"><span class="petal-inner" style="animation-duration: 3s;"></span></span>
              <span class="petal" style="left: 57%; animation-duration: 7.5s; animation-delay: 2.2s;"><span class="petal-inner" style="animation-duration: 2s;"></span></span>
              <span class="petal" style="left: 69%; animation-duration: 9.5s; animation-delay: 4s;"><span class="petal-inner" style="animation-duration: 2.6s;"></span></span>
              <span class="petal" style="left: 82%; animation-duration: 8.5s; animation-delay: 1.7s;"><span class="petal-inner" style="animation-duration: 2.4s;"></span></span>
              <span class="petal" style="left: 92%; animation-duration: 7.2s; animation-delay: 2.9s;"><span class="petal-inner" style="animation-duration: 2.2s;"></span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-surface-container-low border border-secondary-container px-2 py-1 z-10">
              <span class="text-label-badge font-label-badge text-secondary-container block">[BUSHIDO]</span>
              <span class="text-code-telemetry font-code-telemetry text-tertiary">THE WAY OF THE WARRIOR</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-surface-container-low border border-primary-container px-2 py-1 z-10">
              <span class="text-label-badge font-label-badge text-primary-container block">[SAKURA]</span>
              <span class="text-code-telemetry font-code-telemetry text-tertiary">HONOR FALLS // 桜</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-space-md pt-space-sm border-t-2 border-surface-variant flex items-center justify-between text-label-badge font-label-badge text-tertiary">
            <span>HONOR PROTOCOL: ENFORCED</span>
            <span class="text-secondary-container">侍 // ETERNAL WATCH</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
